uafdl (uafdl@u.washington.edu) wrote:
: hi,
: i just acquired exabyte 8200 tape drive without manuals.
: is there anybody direct me how to clean the drive w/ cleaning tape?

If you have REAL Exabyte cleaning tapes, just insert them into the drive.
Wait about 2 minutes, and the tape should be ejected automatically at the
end of the cleaning process.  If you have home video cleaning tapes, well
use them sparingly, they are not recommended!  But if you want to try,
take them out (by hitting the front button) after they come on line
(green light on).  In other words, the cleaning process is in the firmware.
The drive identifies the cleaning tape by sensing how fast the supply reel
rotates during a certain forward motion.  You will notice that the 
cleaning tape doesn't have much tape on the spools.


