harbor some pretty serious doubts about that, and I also doubt that we
could configure an RS/6000 for the same price as the 2000.  

I'd like to hear from anybody who is running one of these machines.  At
this point, I'm not inclined to be picky.  I'll take any help I can get
in selling the 2000 as the platform we need to go with.  Needless to say,
any known gotchas will be appreciated as well.

Probably best to reply direct rather than chew up bandwidth for such a
simple query.  If I get enough useful feedback, I'll post a summary.

