Licenses DON'T expire!  The PAK's may expire, but the license to run a 
specific version of a specific piece of software is ETERNAL.  They can, of
course, just get lost.  And a license allows you to run some specific 
version, not the latest version.  Maybe Campus-Wide License Grants do really
expire, but most universities (ours included) end up buying REAL eternal
licenses for the OS and GUI with the system, because that is how they are
bundled.  I have a thick folder of them in my office.  Of course, we never
update those original licenses, but they are there.  Your university
probably still has them, too.


