 It's news to me if the Rev D keyboard is broken.  I was the one who
 tracked down the problem on the Rev C keyboard (Rev C keyboards are
 only useable on terminals, not on any workstation).  In fact, I'm
 typing this on a Rev D keyboard and have not seen any problems...
