The above status indicates that your machine got a parity error on a 
DMA read from memory by the onboard SCSI channel. The problem could be
the memory SIMM's or the Backup Cache on the CPU Daughter Card. There
is a slight chance that there is something wrong with the memory
interface hardware on the system board.

