want to hook up anything fancy, you can go with the VS3100 series.  The
VS3100/38 is now selling from brokers for about $800.00.  I have seen KA-630
CPU cards for as little as $50.00!  It depends what you are looking to spend,
which you didn't indicate.  We have several people out here who are using
VAXes at home.  Stay away from the VAX-730.  They are all dying or dead, due
to a generic power supply problem.


