>
>I've come accross a freind of mine who is selling a couple 20" RGB 
>monitors for cheap and I want to know if I can hook it up to my DEC 
>5000/20, so far I am not sure. All I know is that these monitors were 
>made by FIMI who apparently made the VR290 monitors for DEC and that 
>these monitors are VR290's in different skins. I guess all I need to know 
>then is if I can use VR290's on my 5000/20. I've called DEC but they said 
>the person who can help me is out for the week and I should try back in a 
>week but I need to know soon. I currently have a VRM17 B&W 17" right now, 
>so if you are looking to buy I am sure I can get you this one for pretty 
>cheap.
