You didn't indicate what model of graphics card you have on the DECstation
5000/20, but from my quick perusal of the catalog, all the graphics cards
available for the 5000/20 are either 66Hz or 72Hz refresh rate.  The VR290 is
60Hz refresh rate.  So, it won't work.

Now, I don't know who this FIMI is, but just because they made some monitors at
some time for DEC doesn't mean that they only made VR290 monitors.  You'd want
to go back to your friend and find out the specs on the monitors.  They might
not be VR290 monitors in different skins, and they might work.  However, if
they are truly VR290, or compatibles, they won't work on your 5000/20.

