This is what I use in a script at our site.  

  rsh remote_host 'vdump -0uf - /file_system | dd ibs=10k obs=64k' |
    dd ibs=64k obs=10k of=/dev/tape_drive

It would get a little hairier if you wanted to make a clone fileset
and dump it instead, but it's not impossible.

