Introducing two new mailing lists
=================================

I would like to introduce two new mailing lists devoted to discussion
of the X11 based terminal emulator Seyon.

 Seyon     - devoted to discussion of general usage/setup of seyon.
 Seyon-dev - devoted to discussion of the future development of Seyon.

Both of these mailing lists can be reached by sending mail to
majordomo@lightning.com.  The mail list manager understands normal
mailing list commands (subscribe, unsubscribe, info, etc.), but will
help you out if you send it an unknown command...

